                <note rend="inline" type="source">660f.116Auto/22: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gittings</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-20T17:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 20,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 20—1:05
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>21. Department’s No. 9, March 15, 5 p.m. It now appears that information was
                    premature because no licenses actually granted yet. I am requesting expedition
                    and will promptly inform Department. Full report by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gittings</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
